  "DELETE /v1/projects/{id}/milestones/{milestone_id}": {"key": "DELETE /v1/projects/{id}/milestones/{milestone_id}", "method": "DELETE", "path": "/v1/projects/{id}/milestones/{milestone_id}", "tag": "project", "summary": "Soft-delete a milestone, UN-ASSIGNING its cards (+ a milestone.deleted activity)", "params": [{"name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string"}}, {"name": "milestone_id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string"}}], "description": "The iteration-delete rule at project scope: `milestoneId` is nullable and \"counts toward no milestone\" is an ordinary state, so this always succeeds and the cards are detached rather than deleted. The sweep is bounded to THIS project — a milestone’s cards cannot be anywhere else — which also keeps it from touching a row the caller’s D verb here does not cover. Requires the project’s projects sub-item D verb.\n\nReplaces DELETE /project/projects/{id}/milestones/{milestoneId}.", "responses": [{"status": "200", "description": "Deleted", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Deleted"}}, {"status": "401", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/StripeError"}}, {"status": "403", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/StripeError"}}, {"status": "404", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/StripeError"}}], "security": ["bearerAuth"], "family": ["DELETE /v1/projects/{id}/milestones/{milestone_id}", "GET /v1/projects/{id}/milestones", "POST /v1/projects/{id}/milestones", "POST /v1/projects/{id}/milestones/{milestone_id}"]},
