  "POST /v1/organizations/{id}/restore": {"key": "POST /v1/organizations/{id}/restore", "method": "POST", "path": "/v1/organizations/{id}/restore", "tag": "registry", "summary": "Restore an archived organization to its own rdid (org creator, org-team admin, or site-admin)", "params": [{"name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string"}}], "description": "Restores the organization under its own slug, and its workspace under the owner's workspace as it is now; an address that moves with it keeps its old form as an alias. A 409 leaves the organization archived: its handle was taken while it was archived, by an organization or as a user slug; `code: owner_org_archived` while the organization that owns it is archived (restore that one first); `code: owner_has_no_workspace` when its owner has no workspace to restore its own into; or the restored addresses would be inconsistent (`violations`).\n\nReplaces POST /organization/organizations/{id}/restore.", "responses": [{"status": "200", "description": "organization", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"allOf": [{"type": "object", "properties": {"object": {"type": "string", "const": "organization"}}}, {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegistryOrganization"}]}}, {"status": "401", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/StripeError"}}, {"status": "403", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/StripeError"}}, {"status": "404", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/StripeError"}}, {"status": "409", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/StripeError"}}], "security": ["bearerAuth"], "family": ["DELETE /v1/organizations/{id}", "GET /v1/organizations", "GET /v1/organizations/{id}", "POST /v1/organizations", "POST /v1/organizations/{id}", "POST /v1/organizations/{id}/restore"]},
